#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2307
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2299
msgid "Connect an AI client"
msgstr "Einen KI-Client verbinden"

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2309
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2301
msgid "Permalink settings"
msgstr "Permalink-Einstellungen"

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2311
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2303
msgid ""
"OAuth discovery needs pretty permalinks. While the permalink structure is "
"set to Plain, WordPress cannot serve the /.well-known/ URLs that AI clients "
"read to find this server, and connecting will fail."
msgstr ""
"OAuth-Erkennung benötigt „schöne“ Permalinks. Solange die "
"Permalink-Struktur auf „Einfach“ eingestellt ist, kann WordPress die "
"/.well-known/ URLs, die KI-Clients zur Servererkennung lesen, nicht "
"bereitstellen, und die Verbindung schlägt fehl."

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2313
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2305
msgid "Pretty permalinks are required"
msgstr "Schöne Permalinks sind erforderlich"

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2315
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2307
msgid ""
"OAuth requires HTTPS. Claude and ChatGPT will refuse to connect to a site "
"served over plain HTTP."
msgstr ""
"OAuth erfordert HTTPS. Claude und ChatGPT verweigern die Verbindung zu "
"einer Website, die über normales HTTP bereitgestellt wird."

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2317
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2309
msgid "HTTPS is required"
msgstr "HTTPS ist erforderlich"

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2319
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2311
msgid ""
"Clients authenticate with OAuth: they discover this server, send you to a "
"WordPress sign-in and consent screen, and receive a token bound to your "
"account. Everything an AI client can do is limited to your own CRM "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Clients authentifizieren sich mit OAuth: sie erkennen diesen Server, leiten "
"Sie zu einer WordPress-Anmelde- und Zustimmungsseite weiter und erhalten "
"ein Token, das an Ihr Konto gebunden ist. Alles, was ein KI-Client tun "
"kann, ist auf Ihre eigenen CRM-Berechtigungen beschränkt."

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2321
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2313
msgid "Or add it manually"
msgstr "Oder manuell hinzufügen"

#: build/bit-crm-sales-marketing-automation/languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2323
#: languages/frontend-extracted-strings.php:2315
msgid ""
"If a connection fails and another MCP plugin is active on this site, try "
"disabling it: two plugins answering OAuth discovery on one site can confuse "
"clients."
msgstr ""
"Falls eine Verbindung fehlschlägt und ein anderes MCP-Plugin auf dieser "
"Seite aktiv ist, versuchen Sie es zu deaktivieren: Zwei Plugins, die auf "
"einer Seite OAuth-Erkennung beantworten, können Clients verwirren."

